  "design": "Retain the contiguous custom-mesh ground/landmark prefix as one command fragment. Character-preset houses keep their original earlier submission priority. Dynamic units, moving foliage, UI and uncovered-room changes remain independent. Replay preserves original primitive order and merges bucket tails into current-frame actor chains. Partial or unsupported draws use normal rendering; no renderer fallback or gameplay changes.",
  "key_storage": "Exact prefix entity keys share the existing whole-world snapshot allocation. Group writes invalidate the whole-world template. Before a whole-world write, group readiness is invalidated unless existing prefix keys still match exactly. Camera snapshots remain independent; no hashes or extra full-entity array.",
