  "limits": [
    "Emulator observations, not hardware validation. Strict keep and combat frame-pacing gates still fail. Camera/moving-unit contexts remain expensive.",
    "The render interval includes the pre-render GPU completion wait and table clear in both versions. Its reduction is not a measurement of isolated CPU instructions or completed GPU time.",
    "Campaign menu/save traversal uses supported stage skip, not a full battle playthrough; separate combat and castle-entry probes use legal actions.",
    "Generated mesh data is immutable under this adapter contract. Future mutable static geometry must invalidate the cache or opt out."
  ],
  "upstream": "Uses existing local optional Mipsync hooks; no additional engine patch or public PR update."
}
